{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53946","headline":"过耒江吊子美 · 李节","name":"过耒江吊子美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耒阳浦口系扁舟，红蓼滩头宿白鸥。\n半夜青灯千里客，数声寒雁一天秋。\n蛩吟隔岸情如诉，斗柄横江势欲流。\n惆怅杜陵老诗伯，断碑古木绕荒丘。\n（《杜诗详注》附《诸家咏杜续编》引《耒阳县志》。\n此诗承陶敏先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李节","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}